      "widgets_values": [
        "<Picture 1> is the identity reference. Fully preserve her face, bone structure, brown eyes, long blonde hair, makeup, and burgundy sleeveless top.\nr34l1sm Realistic live-action cinematic look, action movie trailer, practical film photography, anamorphic lens, film grain.\n<Picture 1> is an adult woman running a rooftop escape at dusk in a wet metropolis. She sprints, leaps a gap between buildings, lands and rolls, then looks back.\nStoryboard:\n[0-1.5s] high side: she sprints the roof edge, coat-less, burgundy top, rain, pursuers in a doorway behind.\n[1.5-3s] mid-air leap between towers, body stretching, flying-car light trails, slight slow motion, face still <Picture 1>.\n[3-4.2s] she lands, rolls, rises, low angle, fog.\n[4.2-5s] freeze on her face matching <Picture 1> as she launches the next jump.\nOne complete body, two arms, two legs, no extra limbs. Audio: wind, rapid footsteps, city ambience, accent hit on each leap. No text, logos, cartoon. Adults only.",
