      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## B70 Ref2VA (identity)\n\nOfficial R2V uses a **different UNet** than T2V/I2V.\n\n- UNet: `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_fp8_scaled` (INT8 ConvRot is CUDA/cu130)\n- Prompt **must** cite `<Picture 1>`\n- `ref_image_size=match` first (faster). Switch to `max` only if ID is weak (slower; tokens ride every step)\n- Official sampler: `res_multistep`, **beta** (or normal) scheduler, **20 steps**\n- Do **not** stack LightX2V turbo-8 here \u2014 those adapters are FL2V-named\n- people LoRA 1.0 is tagged t2v-i2v-**r2v**\n- CLIP on cpu. One job only. 32GB XPU.\n- Face still is from `input/face-reference/portraits/`."
      ],
      "title": "B70 notes"
    }
